      ],
      "content": "CHIPPERFIELD           \tBULSTRODE LANE TL 00 SW  \t\t\t\t\t(South side)                                       6/58                                    \tEast Barn at -                                      \t\tBulstrode Farm                                        \t\t(20m to N of house) GV                                     \t\tII Barn. C17. Timber frame dark weatherboarded but lower part brick nogged. Steep old red tile roofs. A tall 3-bays barn facing E with gabled projecting porch in middle of E side with lean-to outshut on each side, now brick walled. Dark weatherboarded N gable above adjoining brick walled building. Jowled posts with long straight braces to tie beams. Queen-strut and collar trusses in clasped purlin roof. Straight tension braces above half-height rail in rear wall. Full height studs at front. Straight wind braces. Face halved bladed scarf joints in wallplates. (Farmhouse at Bulstrode Farm not listed). Listing NGR: TL0335602966"
    }
  ],
